Dear Agents!
Today, "Rampage Agents" Season 1 - "POLARIS" officially goes live!
This update introduces the Battle Pass system and a more challenging Weekly Task system. We've revamped Barry's tactical skills in [Battle Royale], making the gameplay more competitive and fun!
We know you're eager to start the game!
But wait, we've prepared a series of small rewards for you~
We hope these rewards will support the Agents, dress up in skins, and revel in the festivities!

[h3][b]📌Event Time:[/b][/h3]
December 22, 2023, to January 22, 2024

[h3][b]📌Special Agent Challenge Activities, Xmas Lights costumes are waiting for you to claim: [/b][/h3]
🔹Become a recommender for 3 Agents and receive the Rock Xmas Lights costume;
🔹Use the Custom Dye 10 times in the game to receive the Grim Xmas Lights costume;
🔹Open 15 Rampage Packs in the game to receive the Claire Xmas Lights costume;
🔹Accumulate 1200 damage in a single Battle Royale match to receive the Barry Xmas Lights costume;
🔹Complete any difficulty of Adventure mode once to receive a 100 R Coins reward;
🔹Fight the first level boss in Adventure mode to receive a 100 R Coins reward;
🔹Win the Battle Royale mode twice to receive a 100 R Coins reward;
🔹Gift a Rampage Pack to a friend to receive 200 R Coins.
